        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Rocks</strong> is a challenging and engaging puzzle game where you control a dinosaur navigating through a series of caves. Your goal is to guide the dinosaur to the exit in each level, but the path is filled with a variety of unique blocks that require careful planning and quick thinking. Some blocks are ordinary and safe to walk on, others move only in the direction indicated by arrows, some crumble after being stepped on, some contain colored keys used to unlock matching doors — and there are even teleports!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dino Rocks</i> boasts simple, cartoon-style graphics and diverse level scenarios, with more than 100 levels in total. With its increasing difficulty and clever mechanics, <i>Dino Rocks</i> offers a fun and rewarding mix of logic and reflex-based gameplay — perfect for players who enjoy a thoughtful challenge with a touch of whimsy.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Rocks</strong> is a challenging and engaging puzzle game where you control a dinosaur navigating through a series of caves. Your goal is to guide the dinosaur to the exit in each level, but the path is filled with a variety of unique blocks that require careful planning and quick thinking. Some blocks are ordinary and safe to walk on, others move only in the direction indicated by arrows, some crumble after being stepped on, some contain colored keys used to unlock matching doors — and there are even teleports!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dino Rocks</i> boasts simple, cartoon-style graphics and diverse level scenarios, with more than 100 levels in total. With its increasing difficulty and clever mechanics, <i>Dino Rocks</i> offers a fun and rewarding mix of logic and reflex-based gameplay — perfect for players who enjoy a thoughtful challenge with a touch of whimsy.</p>",
        "short_description": "Dino Rocks is a fun and challenging puzzle game where you guide a dinosaur through over 100 caves filled with crumbling blocks, moving platforms, colored keys, locks, and teleports. With simple cartoon graphics and clever mechanics, it’s perfect for players who enjoy smart, reflex-based puzzles.",
